  3.994449235014043*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8c605e93-958f-4be6-b3ed-\
2102376e0c5d"],

Cell["\<\
P3HT - containing seven thiophenes, and IDTBR  with close contact at the \
middle thiophene of P3HT and left BT of IDTBR, perpendicular to each other, \
and rotated by angle theta and separated by a distance z\
\>", "Text",
